I've noticed a quite a few people are posting bugreports,
including crashes and misbehaviour to this list.

Please always report bugs related to the upstream kernel or
software from netfilter.org to netfilter-devel, or at least
CC it, since thats were most of the developers are. Even
if you think you might have misconfigured something, things
like crashes should never happen and are always a bug.

Thanks.
